/target
/data
/dist
# Building the excluded vendored crate on its own (to check a patch) creates
# these; the workspace has its own lock file one level up.
vendor/*/target/
vendor/*/Cargo.lock
.env
app/build/
app/.dart_tool/
app/data/

# Local AI-assistant/editor state. None of this is part of the project:
# per-machine chat history, task state and prompt files. `AGENTS.md`, the
# committed FRB bindings and the hand-written docs stay tracked.
.freebuff/
.claude/
.cursor/
.codex/
.continue/
.windsurf/
.aider*
*.local.md
*.prompt.md

# Local UI captures and recordings made while debugging.
/screenshots/
/scratch/
